Cl4 n0 0 20f
VDD vdd 0 1.6
.ic v(n0)=0
.control
tran 1e-11 2.1e-07 0 1e-11
meas tran iavg avg i(VDD) from=6e-08 to=2.1e-07
wrdata /tmp/claude-0/-home-user/24b1423c-959f-5794-9f98-bbcbade8908e/scratchpad/review_r2c/res/a_f_CS5_1.6.txt v(n0) v(vdd)
